These numerical explorations confirm that $A(x,d_{res})$ provides a structured, tunable landscape. The choice of $d_{res}$ allows selection of the "resolution" at which this landscape is viewed, while $N_{ord}$ sets its fundamental modal structure. This landscape is the basis upon which the RGM guides search.

